1
00:00:00,046 --> 00:00:02,756
(Penny:)Well, in that case,
do you mind giving me some advice?

2
00:00:02,924 --> 00:00:04,214
(Leonard:)About Stuart?

3
00:00:04,384 --> 00:00:05,804
(Leonard:)Love to.

4
00:00:05,969 --> 00:00:09,429
(Penny:)He's very shy. How do I make him
feel more comfortable around me?

5
00:00:09,597 --> 00:00:13,897
Well, first of all, don't underestimate
the value of discomfort.

6
00:00:14,561 --> 00:00:17,191
- Really?
- Well, yeah. Stuart thrives under pressure.

7
00:00:17,355 --> 00:00:20,105
(Leonard:)That's why he works
in a comic-book store.

8
00:00:23,278 --> 00:00:24,908
[PHONE RINGING]

9
00:00:26,072 --> 00:00:27,402
(Sheldon:)Oh.

10
00:00:27,949 --> 00:00:29,079
(Leonard:)It's Stuart.

11
00:00:29,242 --> 00:00:31,122
[PHONE RINGING]

12
00:00:32,704 --> 00:00:34,584
(Sheldon:)You're not going to answer it?

13
00:00:35,915 --> 00:00:38,705
(Leonard:)He wants to talk about Penny.
I don't wanna talk about Penny.

14
00:00:39,502 --> 00:00:40,882
(Sheldon:)You're making an assumption.

15
00:00:42,422 --> 00:00:44,592
(Sheldon:)Perhaps the comic book store is on fire.

16
00:00:45,925 --> 00:00:47,255
(Sheldon:)And he needs your assistance.

17
00:00:47,886 --> 00:00:50,056
(Leonard:)Why would he call me?

18
00:00:50,221 --> 00:00:52,311
(Sheldon:)We don't know.

19
00:00:52,474 --> 00:00:55,434
(Sheldon:)And if you don't answer the phone,
we can't know.

20
00:00:56,936 --> 00:00:59,226
(Leonard:)I'm not answering the phone, Sheldon.

